sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant UI as 前端输入
    participant Adapter as AG99 Adapter
    participant AstrBot as AstrBot Persona Runtime
    participant LLM as 主模型
    participant TTS as TTS
    participant Store as SessionStore
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Timeline as PlaybackTimeline
    participant Audio as HTMLAudioElement
    participant Lip as Lip-sync
    participant Engine as ModelEngine
    participant SDK as Live2D WebSDK
    participant Done as CompletionCoordinator

    User->>UI: 输入消息
    UI->>Adapter: input.text(turn_id)
    Adapter->>AstrBot: 提交本轮消息并注入动作能力
    AstrBot->>LLM: system + capability + context
    LLM-->>AstrBot: spoken_reply + effect_calls[ag99live.motion]
    AstrBot->>TTS: spoken_reply
    par 动作结果
        AstrBot->>Adapter: view.effect_calls
        Adapter->>Adapter: 校验并生成 motion_intent.v4
    and 语音合成
        TTS-->>Adapter: Record(WAV, caption)
    end

    Adapter-->>Store: engine.motion_intent(turn_id, message_id)
    Adapter-->>Store: output.audio(audio_url, caption_text)
    Adapter-->>Store: output.text(visible text)
    Adapter-->>Store: control.synth_finished
    Note over Store: Record 与 Plain 可以物理分开发送<br/>但必须归并到同一逻辑 segment

    Store->>Orch: text/audio/motion facts changed
    Orch->>Timeline: startSegmentJob(text, audio, motion)
    Timeline->>UI: release visible text
    Timeline->>Audio: start(audio_url)
    Audio->>Lip: attach same HTMLAudioElement
    Timeline->>Timeline: register required motion sink
    Audio-->>Timeline: loadedmetadata(duration)
    Audio-->>Timeline: playing(real audio clock)
    Timeline->>Lip: start RMS sampling
    Timeline->>Timeline: wait 90ms
    Timeline->>Engine: start motion with matching timeline snapshot
    Engine->>Engine: validate → axis sample → relation graph → timing
    Engine->>SDK: parameter_plan.v2 + runId

    loop 每个动画帧
        Audio-->>Lip: WebAudio RMS
        Lip->>SDK: mouth value + speech energy
        Timeline-->>SDK: audio currentTime
        SDK->>SDK: gesture interpolation + dynamics + physics
    end

    Audio-->>Timeline: audio completed
    Lip-->>Timeline: lip_sync completed/failed
    SDK-->>Timeline: motion completed/failed
    Timeline-->>Store: sink terminals
    Store->>Done: locally settled + synth_finished
    Done->>Adapter: control.playback_finished(success)
    Adapter-->>Store: control.turn_finished
    Store-->>UI: session completed
